dsh-prompt-polish
================

This project is an independent, community-maintained DeepSeek Harness plugin.

It evolved from "提示词优化 Prompt Optimizer" (ptopt-1, pkg-1 … pkg-11), a
dynamic Cordis plugin prototyped and iterated inside the author's DeepSeek
Harness sessions. The bundle form published in this repository is a faithful
port of that v11 behavior:

- strategy templates, voice rules and language fragments (lib/shared.js) are
  kept byte-identical to pkg-11;
- the client UI (lib/client.js) preserves the pkg-11 interaction model,
  including the confirm dialog, last-5 history and three-tier settings
  persistence.

